&lt;/h2>&lt;p>本指南详细介绍了如何将Grafana从其他数据库（如SQLite或MySQL）迁移到PostgreSQL，并解决迁移过程中常见的问题，特别是&amp;quot;role does not exist&amp;quot;错误。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Pgpool-II 监控方案</title><link>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/pgpool-ii-%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/pgpool-ii-%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88/</guid><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/">数据库</category><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7/">监控</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="pgpool-ii-监控方案">&lt;span>Pgpool-II 监控方案&lt;/span>
